<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:19Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-ger" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-1432?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-ger" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Young Berliners vote overwhelmingly for socialist Left  Party</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:400bdd077c2657f17e1b05d42918fb675225623bdb5f5d0d64416106d0141cb7</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/young-berliners-vote-overwhelmingly-for-socialist-left-party/a-79375167--9c7d9060df7e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/young-berliners-vote-overwhelmingly-for-socialist-left-party/a-79375167?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Berlin's young voters overwhelmingly supported the victorious socialist Left Party. Are the young more radical? Or are the election results just a reflection of current German politics?</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Amateur archeologist unearths Germany's largest trove of Roman coins</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ef1199019cc7ab51da272e822372a92baf17b87fd1aac162f3ba82aaffb498bc</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T17:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/amateur-archeologist-unearths-germany-s-largest-trove-of-roman-coins/a-79379127--cd97ff72e024.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/amateur-archeologist-unearths-germany-s-largest-trove-of-roman-coins/a-79379127?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">What began as a routine search in a field near Wesseling led to the discovery of nearly 1,000 Roman silver coins, one of the most significant archaeological finds in Germany in recent years.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Military aircraft crashes near US air base in Spangdahlem, Germany</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2ebf0f19f86ea2f505d8fa599e5fcbd034ac83673194379c3e4db48d002f404e</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/military-aircraft-crashes-near-us-air-base-in-spangdahlem-germany/a-79376025--82e638c408d1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/military-aircraft-crashes-near-us-air-base-in-spangdahlem-germany/a-79376025?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The F-16 pilot was able to safely eject from the plane and was taken to receive medical care. The incident occurred near Spangdahlem Air Base in the German state of Rhineland-Palatinate.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: VW to step up cost-cutting program</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:02d80d634c2b63d0701a3e62fea49ceb9d95fdfe45244b9d8ab3700c54ffa5d6</id><updated>2026-09-23T04:54:19Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T07:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-vw-to-step-up-cost-cutting-program/live-79365190--a755a3e03dbc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-vw-to-step-up-cost-cutting-program/live-79365190?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Volkswagen's chief says the carmaker will accelerate its streamlining measures as workers protest. The Israeli ambassador says the Left Party win in Berlin polls poses a risk to the city's Jewish community. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Trial starts of ex-Transport Minister Scheuer</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:08d04729187c6a56a4c6619bd5f0b81e189f1dfc402b6